+  stock-driven, `r_HDRHalation 2` as the diagnostic).
+- `docs/ConsoleReference.md`: `r_HDRHalation` entry next to `r_HDRStreaks`; `HDR_Halation_*`
+  in the post-param list; note that the component overwrites them every frame like the
+  streaks params.
+
